{"id": "1272-135031-0022", "text": "TRUE AGREED KALIKO", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1272/135031/1272-135031-0022.flac", "audio_sha256": "0d3573eac7e74ab8c05a5743b050bd6bda2e6f73629bc7ec338394206a29e7f2", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1272", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 43120, "duration": 2.695}
{"id": "1272-141231-0007", "text": "ONLY HIS HEART AND LUNGS WORKED ON AT A STRONG MEASURED RATE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1272/141231/1272-141231-0007.flac", "audio_sha256": "1cc95ce7c6be4352b94c10d77a4b0475ccc5ad543b0d3a5f791459963ce4efb1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1272", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 75760, "duration": 4.735}
{"id": "1462-170142-0000", "text": "THE LAST TWO DAYS OF THE VOYAGE BARTLEY FOUND ALMOST INTOLERABLE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1462/170142/1462-170142-0000.flac", "audio_sha256": "08c17c6a59de702386a5c79b49b9d8f7fce1870b2d89b68607523f11d07b61ce", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1462", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 75440, "duration": 4.715}
{"id": "1462-170142-0002", "text": "SHE BLUSHED AND SMILED AND FUMBLED HIS CARD IN HER CONFUSION BEFORE SHE RAN UPSTAIRS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1462/170142/1462-170142-0002.flac", "audio_sha256": "dbc441b62de949f9fafdb9912167b19f9038224144849cfceefc642d73b26fda", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1462", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 103200, "duration": 6.45}
{"id": "1673-143397-0012", "text": "SIXTY EIGHT BISHOPS TWENTY TWO OF METROPOLITAN RANK DEFENDED HIS CAUSE BY A MODEST AND TEMPERATE PROTEST THEY WERE EXCLUDED FROM THE COUNCILS OF THEIR BRETHREN", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1673/143397/1673-143397-0012.flac", "audio_sha256": "07dafa64c24e9f3b1fced4729f31ecefc5cdc0c03b54877ed79e8767d3bdaa1b", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1673", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 149280, "duration": 9.33}
{"id": "1919-142785-0044", "text": "BOIL FOR FIVE MINUTES MINCE IT VERY SMALL AND MIX IT WITH THE OTHER INGREDIENTS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1919/142785/1919-142785-0044.flac", "audio_sha256": "d60a947c81792be030a07892deaf9a219fd5b1b0684c1082949accf442e608f3", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1919", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 92320, "duration": 5.77}
{"id": "1919-142785-0062", "text": "SUFFICIENT HALF THIS QUANTITY FOR TWO SLICES OF SALMON", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1919/142785/1919-142785-0062.flac", "audio_sha256": "6ae24eae0e76f80441e22b2355f5a3bda515c7ca218a14677b448f07a35e8074", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1919", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66240, "duration": 4.14}
{"id": "1988-148538-0009", "text": "IF I SAY TO AN AMERICAN THAT THE COUNTRY HE LIVES IN IS A FINE ONE AY HE REPLIES THERE IS NOT ITS FELLOW IN THE WORLD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1988/148538/1988-148538-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "3d82a68a9edbe3810b1f3d791e12e0e141baa2e09bc07dcce63f59fa8a707f52", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1988", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 118400, "duration": 7.4}
{"id": "1988-24833-0023", "text": "TOM SAYS THANKS AND LOOKS AT HILDA AND SHE BLUSHES REALLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1988/24833/1988-24833-0023.flac", "audio_sha256": "5a6935a74357918762e7cca5731f79d92bc370750e152c7ae95621a1217b7352", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1988", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 69120, "duration": 4.32}
{"id": "1993-147149-0013", "text": "MARY AND ALICE DREW NEAR THE FIRE AND STOOD IN QUIET SORROW FOR SOME TIME", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1993/147149/1993-147149-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "adc41338c4d0ec3ba0268c54cd41ca6c60e095d35a7f0bf856ecc22569ed1304", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1993", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 81200, "duration": 5.075}
{"id": "1993-147965-0004", "text": "ALL AFTERNOON HE SAT IN THE DINING ROOM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/1993/147965/1993-147965-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "69d39861945a51791a67fbdd17911d116e7f6410cdbcba7f18ff4c68b0e3b6fc", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "1993", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 46640, "duration": 2.915}
{"id": "2035-147961-0005", "text": "THEY MADE ME THINK OF DEFEATED ARMIES RETREATING OR OF GHOSTS WHO WERE TRYING DESPERATELY TO GET IN FOR SHELTER AND THEN WENT MOANING ON", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147961/2035-147961-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "fb3debb7804e7f2bfeac249efa8ab59bd589224abc5053939987a68f5c17136d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 150720, "duration": 9.42}
{"id": "2035-147961-0017", "text": "MISTER SHIMERDA WENT WITH HIM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2035/147961/2035-147961-0017.flac", "audio_sha256": "904e3062f99a9a702ca2499d52be8df67fba9e4863bc21b0a4446c318b1ecf35", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2035", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 32160, "duration": 2.01}
{"id": "2078-142845-0036", "text": "PLAIN BUNS SEVENTEEN TWENTY NINE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2078/142845/2078-142845-0036.flac", "audio_sha256": "93199996de17c7363b639625f1bfc1ff0c2262c61fef8c739ccad0d976f1ede6", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2078", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 59520, "duration": 3.72}
{"id": "2428-83705-0017", "text": "I FOUND THAT AS A WOMAN OF BUSINESS SHE WAS BEYOND ALL MY EXPECTATIONS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2428/83705/2428-83705-0017.flac", "audio_sha256": "be3dcec6af3e163a8d02e3e62e98b635d9fdd2c09903add3fe61b8836d2631cb", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2428", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 79840, "duration": 4.99}
{"id": "251-136532-0002", "text": "THAT TOOK THE CENTER OF INTEREST AWAY FROM ARCHAEOLOGY AND STARTED A NEW BURST OF ACTIVITY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/136532/251-136532-0002.flac", "audio_sha256": "2b8158136bff3efabf77592da3059a95a6b111c72ffd69603cc1996029694019", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 104800, "duration": 6.55}
{"id": "251-136532-0007", "text": "IT WAS LOCKED FROM THE INSIDE AND WE HAD TO BURN IT DOWN WITH A TORCH THAT'S WHERE THEY ARE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/136532/251-136532-0007.flac", "audio_sha256": "83db06c18e8dc27f1adda56ece650f91aeca83cce99348fe25b2f21eeba7b268", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 89680, "duration": 5.605}
{"id": "251-137823-0001", "text": "INSIDE A SECRET ROCKET TELEMETERING DEVICE WAS MOUNTED ON ITS TEST STAND", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/251/137823/251-137823-0001.flac", "audio_sha256": "4f1895f61d9b2929db694a8d9cb26022fc2aabf3281deed8fe42cc636c92cd6d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "251", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 87680, "duration": 5.48}
{"id": "2803-154328-0004", "text": "IF IT IS DECREED THAT WE DIE TO MORROW LET US DIE BRAVELY LIKE CHRISTIAN MEN READY TO APPEAR WITHOUT TERROR BEFORE THE SUPREME JUDGE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2803/154328/2803-154328-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "f4b6866d4098849ffce178368ac20a40e6404ba3797c3738d0f2cf5c503996cc", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2803", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 179040, "duration": 11.19}
{"id": "2902-9006-0010", "text": "THE MENS SANA MUST HAVE A CORPUS SANUM TO INHABIT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/2902/9006/2902-9006-0010.flac", "audio_sha256": "6475e42f8f9710253f2be19c17d396dae69c84241385701592defb49717762ee", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "2902", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 66720, "duration": 4.17}
{"id": "3081-166546-0000", "text": "WHEN WE TOOK OUR SEATS AT THE BREAKFAST TABLE IT WAS WITH THE FEELING OF BEING NO LONGER LOOKED UPON AS CONNECTED IN ANY WAY WITH THIS CASE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3081/166546/3081-166546-0000.flac", "audio_sha256": "a0a99c5c2f9da504669449e9f085f0963e75e4fe2968e69c9f8bb81538653e7a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3081", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 168000, "duration": 10.5}
{"id": "3170-137482-0014", "text": "NEVER FEAR YOU SHALL SEE HIM AGAIN TO MORROW", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3170/137482/3170-137482-0014.flac", "audio_sha256": "97feaf09c07529c8ae09e6a0c00ab506c2880108322fa37b3afa0a71acd621c7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3170", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 56320, "duration": 3.52}
{"id": "3536-23268-0020", "text": "MISS WOODLEY DID NOT RECOLLECT HERSELF SO BUT WAS SO IN REALITY IN HER PEACE AND CHARITY WERE INSTINCTIVE VIRTUES ACCIDENT COULD NOT INCREASE THEM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3536/23268/3536-23268-0020.flac", "audio_sha256": "8d37d88cfdb814a1d430d3b248ad9af2242c0e63f4c13bb229af845e563421b8", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 164320, "duration": 10.27}
{"id": "3536-23268-0025", "text": "IT IS OFTEN THE UNGRATEFUL TASK OF A FRIEND TO BE TROUBLESOME SOMETIMES UNMANNERLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3536/23268/3536-23268-0025.flac", "audio_sha256": "2868e29affe2d6f89c8d8ee4f09037cbc4f45dd24f99fb95b10e214b99923539", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 80240, "duration": 5.015}
{"id": "3536-8226-0016", "text": "DOES ONE MISTER SAMUEL BOZZLE LIVE HERE ASKED TREVELYAN", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3536/8226/3536-8226-0016.flac", "audio_sha256": "7b6d4ad13c9e770ac811fd223b6a1b1ac13e92c1119934a11fc84342258f7f83", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 75840, "duration": 4.74}
{"id": "3752-4944-0018", "text": "I SUPPOSE SEVERITY IS NECESSARY RETURNED MEEKIN THOUGH TO MY EARS A FLOGGING SOUNDS A LITTLE DISTASTEFUL", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3752/4944/3752-4944-0018.flac", "audio_sha256": "c563404a726aceaba724ed2f0fc3402c409ee3e09ea2590062c1817cb8fd6755", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3752", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 118000, "duration": 7.375}
{"id": "3752-4944-0048", "text": "I AM A MINISTER OF GOD SIR AND I FORBID YOU TO COMMIT THIS CRIME", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3752/4944/3752-4944-0048.flac", "audio_sha256": "5f6b33591c6866d3b6134415ae2040e6015f6d23d15a5aba1c0aeb9dbd1510b4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3752", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 77280, "duration": 4.83}
{"id": "3853-163249-0014", "text": "DAVID WAS SOBER ENOUGH NOW AND WENT ABOUT HIS WORK WITH A GRIM SET TO HIS LIPS AND A SPARK IN HIS EYES THAT MADE THE THREE WOMEN LOOK AT ONE ANOTHER PALE WITH UNSPOKEN APPREHENSION", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3853/163249/3853-163249-0014.flac", "audio_sha256": "0588e0cdbf1ff6da316165795c83c7de41b2a79ecc220b959e669c5d35b659e0", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3853", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 175040, "duration": 10.94}
{"id": "3853-163249-0043", "text": "NOTHING CAN PART US ANY MORE NOT EVEN DEATH FOR LOVE LIKE OURS WILL LAST FOR EVER", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/3853/163249/3853-163249-0043.flac", "audio_sha256": "44cbf0fff709d5f3811d6e96a3fc795562304f0b722c546b3aa3a015d73aced7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "3853", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 90560, "duration": 5.66}
{"id": "422-122949-0007", "text": "ACCORDING TO SLAVE MORALITY THEREFORE THE EVIL MAN AROUSES FEAR ACCORDING TO MASTER MORALITY IT IS PRECISELY THE GOOD MAN WHO AROUSES FEAR AND SEEKS TO AROUSE IT WHILE THE BAD MAN IS REGARDED AS THE DESPICABLE BEING", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/422/122949/422-122949-0007.flac", "audio_sha256": "42eef5cdd3242d61119c9bd35f2f12c5a75d96fca8207de752b8f684437100af", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "422", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 238880, "duration": 14.93}
{"id": "5338-24615-0005", "text": "THIS AVENUE WAS STRAIGHT AND OF MODERATE LENGTH RUNNING BETWEEN A DOUBLE ROW OF VERY ANCIENT HORSE CHESTNUTS PLANTED ALTERNATELY WITH SYCAMORES WHICH ROSE TO SUCH HUGE HEIGHT AND NOURISHED SO LUXURIANTLY THAT THEIR BOUGHS COMPLETELY OVER ARCHED THE BROAD ROAD BENEATH", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5338/24615/5338-24615-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "8c6a5d20c820b658337d3309701999535dd01594b3e6605ceb1c72d0a49e414c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5338", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 284320, "duration": 17.77}
{"id": "5536-43359-0012", "text": "WHEN HE BECOMES AN OLD MAN HE LOVES TO MAKE A NOTABLE EFFORT TO PROVE HIS GRATITUDE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5536/43359/5536-43359-0012.flac", "audio_sha256": "af8a5bc0511aaabd08e37a80027202e51f165e1bf114918f4e9cb70e42316b68", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 77040, "duration": 4.815}
{"id": "5536-43359-0018", "text": "THIS BOND IS BETWEEN MAN AND MAN IS USUALLY FORMED IN EARLY YOUTH AND CAN ONLY BE BROKEN BY DEATH", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5536/43359/5536-43359-0018.flac", "audio_sha256": "08646b5101a5a8aeb792ee9bb36720c5770348e684ff68cb69c50556f98e0d31", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5536", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 95680, "duration": 5.98}
{"id": "5694-64038-0011", "text": "BUT HOW TO GET HIM OUT WAS THE UNSOLVED PROBLEM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5694/64038/5694-64038-0011.flac", "audio_sha256": "d276aafdbede9502f39bfd11f550b234d7bf528b8047b6218ed8b17356bbe299", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5694", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 47920, "duration": 2.995}
{"id": "5694-64038-0018", "text": "WE WERE INURED TO PRIVATIONS AND HARDSHIPS HAD BEEN UPON EVERY MARCH IN EVERY BATTLE IN EVERY SKIRMISH IN EVERY ADVANCE IN EVERY RETREAT IN EVERY VICTORY IN EVERY DEFEAT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5694/64038/5694-64038-0018.flac", "audio_sha256": "291e47283dcd892e3302d386d3c08fc497c6457e359a2bb369948fc2fbd145a8", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5694", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 188720, "duration": 11.795}
{"id": "5895-34615-0005", "text": "GWYNPLAINE WAS A MOUNTEBANK", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5895/34615/5895-34615-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "fd89d6680dde62d5a08a4119b04094aee11673d4a114c1c863e1e2d77cf101fe", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5895", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 39920, "duration": 2.495}
{"id": "5895-34615-0021", "text": "THE OPERATION WHATEVER IT HAD BEEN WHICH HAD DEPRIVED HIS FEATURES OF HARMONY AND PUT ALL THEIR FLESH INTO DISORDER HAD HAD NO EFFECT ON THE BONY STRUCTURE OF HIS HEAD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5895/34615/5895-34615-0021.flac", "audio_sha256": "f1f6e81281bffcd6228dd2e4368f4646b5e8f5682789da744c59168663f90786", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5895", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 194480, "duration": 12.155}
{"id": "5895-34622-0014", "text": "FOR THESE READ FIBI AND VINOS THAT WE MAY CONFORM TO ENGLISH PRONUNCIATION", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5895/34622/5895-34622-0014.flac", "audio_sha256": "708b6042e846e2de023677f9ac4bb3e3958d341684b8030ffd196a57486a1c11", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5895", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 94000, "duration": 5.875}
{"id": "5895-34629-0023", "text": "AT EVERY PERFORMANCE THE YARD OF THE INN TRANSFORMED INTO A PIT WAS FILLED WITH A RAGGED AND ENTHUSIASTIC AUDIENCE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/5895/34629/5895-34629-0023.flac", "audio_sha256": "a19232ee5266ce74936a4fe5d01009e781599a4b22cbcffcdb42d0951453c122", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "5895", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 126320, "duration": 7.895}
{"id": "6241-61943-0024", "text": "I HAVE NOT THE SLIGHTEST DOUBT THAT IN HIGH WINDS ITS RED TILES WERE BLOWN OUT TO THE GREAT ANNOYANCE OF THE PASTOR AND CONGREGATION", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6241/61943/6241-61943-0024.flac", "audio_sha256": "66bdc7312206c45a43a43441ef294743def3c352ced435c503354f250b584000", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6241", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 117760, "duration": 7.36}
{"id": "6241-66616-0002", "text": "WHILE THE ATTACK WAS SUCCESSFUL IN A WAY ITS MAIN PURPOSE FAILED", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6241/66616/6241-66616-0002.flac", "audio_sha256": "2e217d642cca26676f405cc36180f8bd4aef773ebbf2458cced53baf7d58e7a5", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6241", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 67120, "duration": 4.195}
{"id": "6241-66616-0004", "text": "THREE DAYS LATER MINNETAKI BECAME NEWSOME'S WIFE AT THE HUDSON BAY POST", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6241/66616/6241-66616-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "4053f329fbfea4b439a20587c8118e6ab0f9cbec053e2aa0a7e31c0e01d5f469", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6241", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 77520, "duration": 4.845}
{"id": "6295-244435-0027", "text": "HE WAS GOING HOME AFTER VICTORY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/244435/6295-244435-0027.flac", "audio_sha256": "ed71ec5ed527d62d5a92550940659b65da38c7cae45fbf290d7283dccebf1492", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 38720, "duration": 2.42}
{"id": "6295-244435-0030", "text": "PEOPLE WERE COOLER HERE AND THEY WERE MORE PRONE TO LOOK AT THE TWO SIDES OF A QUESTION", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/244435/6295-244435-0030.flac", "audio_sha256": "dfd84b57ef753e69a4cdeff73a9bc24cf56cdb1c18484cf1f7c8bb207a8582ef", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 88720, "duration": 5.545}
{"id": "6295-64301-0025", "text": "A SOB LIKE A BIRD NEW BORN BURST FROM MARY'S BOSOM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/64301/6295-64301-0025.flac", "audio_sha256": "61406c4305955315f0e1f4687baa55968728ca24c318f7637eb50a3ff110be3d", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 91280, "duration": 5.705}
{"id": "6295-64301-0026", "text": "THAT ENCHANTMENT HAD POSSESSED HIM USURPING AS IT WERE THE THRONE OF HIS LIFE AND DISPLACING IT WHEN IT CEASED HE WAS NOT HIS OWN MASTER", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6295/64301/6295-64301-0026.flac", "audio_sha256": "5d1aa74a05fc2494850f6725a372ea2e8d86d96578fb57f7f2ebbbba3ddad36a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6295", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 166880, "duration": 10.43}
{"id": "6313-66125-0005", "text": "I COULD NOT THINK OF ALLOWING ANY OF MY CHARGES TO TAKE SO TERRIBLE A RISK AND", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/66125/6313-66125-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "656e1a767ddede327812c9f9e96246da04d00abcf49fe03ea850b94ac574291f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 74240, "duration": 4.64}
{"id": "6313-66129-0011", "text": "YES THE COUNTRY IS FULL OF CAVES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/66129/6313-66129-0011.flac", "audio_sha256": "5d95537766b86c337747ba9d77c4cdfe461c9ad9aedbc805195ecf5f9935f828", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 35440, "duration": 2.215}
{"id": "6313-66129-0013", "text": "BUT I KNOW AN OLD SETTLER WHO WILL LEND US HIS DOG IF IT IS NOT OUT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/66129/6313-66129-0013.flac", "audio_sha256": "0eceec486d3d6c656520fe430cf3efb070fd0cc3519835871a17c0428a9aff4f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 57680, "duration": 3.605}
{"id": "6313-66129-0014", "text": "SUPPER HAVING BEEN FINISHED THE PARTY GATHERED ABOUT THE CAMP FIRE FOR THEIR EVENING CHAT AFTER WHICH ADMONISHING STACY TO KEEP WITHIN HIS TENT AND NOT TO GO BORROWING TROUBLE THE BOYS TURNED IN FOR A SOUND SLEEP", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/66129/6313-66129-0014.flac", "audio_sha256": "8fc20491d1c2a7682d955e81b830652f38bb2f7074de7e09ae44e672be3794be", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 181360, "duration": 11.335}
{"id": "6313-76958-0025", "text": "A WRANGLER'S A WRANGLER ANSWERED BIG FOOT STOLIDLY", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6313/76958/6313-76958-0025.flac", "audio_sha256": "59637f31b60288565ae26e0e248082bf8c5403cdf8a47ae9855770b1af698129", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6313", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 60720, "duration": 3.795}
{"id": "6319-275224-0009", "text": "INDEED NOT A FLOWER ESCAPED HIS MISCHIEVOUS SUGGESTIONS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6319/275224/6319-275224-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "746eb17247f9cac0eca368b76d2b4333700e77366298e165cd072b601162fe52", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6319", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 72720, "duration": 4.545}
{"id": "6319-57405-0010", "text": "WHAT DID HE MEAN ASKED PYRRHA", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6319/57405/6319-57405-0010.flac", "audio_sha256": "a506c0ca6b98fb36163a980f428f2575e52ebd0b39ad9f64243e0592da33e84b", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6319", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 53440, "duration": 3.34}
{"id": "6319-64726-0004", "text": "NOW FIFTEEN YEARS AFTER THE PRINCESS WAS BORN SHE WAS WITH THE KING AND QUEEN AT ONE OF THEIR CASTLES AND AS SHE WAS RUNNING ABOUT BY HERSELF SHE CAME TO A LITTLE CHAMBER AT THE TOP OF A TOWER AND THERE SAT AN HONEST OLD WOMAN SPINNING FOR SHE HAD NEVER HEARD OF THE KING'S EDICT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6319/64726/6319-64726-0004.flac", "audio_sha256": "a0c6b2b62fa616d29911c4d1f7db957851d485c13db2b742dce46c97fccf1fb1", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6319", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 305600, "duration": 19.1}
{"id": "6345-64257-0001", "text": "AT THE TIME MARY HAD NOTED NOTHING OF THESE THINGS NOW SHE SAW THEM ALL AS FOR THE FIRST TIME IN MINUTE DETAIL WHILE SLOWLY SHE WENT UP THE STAIR AND THROUGH THE NARROWED WAYS AND HEARD THE SAME WIND THAT RAVED ALIKE ABOUT THE NEW GRAVE AND THE OLD HOUSE INTO WHICH LATTER FOR ALL THE BALES BANKED AGAINST THE WALLS IT FOUND MANY A CHINK OF ENTRANCE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/64257/6345-64257-0001.flac", "audio_sha256": "87425b7b2be979ac3d63888fc70d39637577dd47393592a939f2a4b83000349f", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 350880, "duration": 21.93}
{"id": "6345-93302-0002", "text": "YOU SEE THAT SHE KNEW EXACTLY HOW A TRYST IS CONDUCTED IN THE PAGES OF THE STANDARD POETS AND OF THE CHEAPER WEEKLY JOURNALS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0002.flac", "audio_sha256": "beeecaac4cb3933adb36f13be794bdb67a00bd0997522bff1fd2130b7f544007", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 120800, "duration": 7.55}
{"id": "6345-93302-0007", "text": "IT WAS BITTERLY COLD BUT THE EMBANKMENT WAS MORE ROMANTIC THAN A RAILWAY CARRIAGE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/6345/93302/6345-93302-0007.flac", "audio_sha256": "98e9a7d598bad89ee619d61be962102e7f28007e7239eb1d094e6fb069a2ff0c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "6345", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 69920, "duration": 4.37}
{"id": "652-130726-0027", "text": "PUT INTO THE OVEN AGAIN AND COOK FOR HALF AN HOUR BASTING FREQUENTLY WITH THE ORIGINAL BRINE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/652/130726/652-130726-0027.flac", "audio_sha256": "cda1d51ed984523591f42715f0115be1a2c8a2722c6270337f4e7fc3bb5b4f57", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "652", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 83760, "duration": 5.235}
{"id": "777-126732-0003", "text": "MICHAELIS THE TICKET OF LEAVE APOSTLE WAS SPEAKING IN AN EVEN VOICE A VOICE THAT WHEEZED AS IF DEADENED AND OPPRESSED BY THE LAYER OF FAT ON HIS CHEST", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0003.flac", "audio_sha256": "906ee074b72e20c502526890bfdba26a246803c52e2779317b498224c8e65cc9", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 151200, "duration": 9.45}
{"id": "777-126732-0011", "text": "THE POSSESSORS OF PROPERTY HAD NOT ONLY TO FACE THE AWAKENED PROLETARIAT BUT THEY HAD ALSO TO FIGHT AMONGST THEMSELVES YES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0011.flac", "audio_sha256": "7727f26755542071166aec4afaa98b1f177c4a6ed4a413b0e55932e278e8de54", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 119200, "duration": 7.45}
{"id": "777-126732-0015", "text": "A HARSH LAUGH FROM COMRADE OSSIPON CUT THE TIRADE DEAD SHORT IN A SUDDEN FALTERING OF THE TONGUE AND A BEWILDERED UNSTEADINESS OF THE APOSTLE'S MILDLY EXALTED EYES", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "d34c55b08a7f5c258eca95e55ad10577ad8f390b005b52ab45df7fa4c767f428", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 152160, "duration": 9.51}
{"id": "777-126732-0024", "text": "THE SHADOW OF HIS EVIL GIFT CLUNG TO HIM YET LIKE THE SMELL OF A DEADLY DRUG IN AN OLD VIAL OF POISON EMPTIED NOW USELESS READY TO BE THROWN AWAY UPON THE RUBBISH HEAP OF THINGS THAT HAD SERVED THEIR TIME", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0024.flac", "audio_sha256": "9deebb41497e42b81e85e0d438081e484ccf843a4625343f36d21bc4708dd4a5", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 217600, "duration": 13.6}
{"id": "777-126732-0042", "text": "HE CLOSED THE DOOR BEHIND THEIR BACKS WITH RESTRAINED VIOLENCE TURNED THE KEY SHOT THE BOLT", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0042.flac", "audio_sha256": "bd141fb47553cadab9ed90ca553564fcbd0b6d559ba493d40f42806b12d92804", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 89120, "duration": 5.57}
{"id": "777-126732-0077", "text": "HE GETS A RED FACE PORING OVER THEM", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/777/126732/777-126732-0077.flac", "audio_sha256": "58dd8914ec7396c13da3f49956b9fb8aeeddfdb8b4e051db57c8af8c46434eb4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "777", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 38480, "duration": 2.405}
{"id": "7850-111771-0007", "text": "TIME WORE AWAY AND ON THE NINTH OF APRIL EIGHTEEN SIXTY FIVE GRANT CAPTURED THE CONFEDERATE ARMY UNDER LEE THUS VIRTUALLY ENDING THE WAR", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7850/111771/7850-111771-0007.flac", "audio_sha256": "6f1b17fd6f49f51075d84c3c5623aaed1db90716165b2086f73a464c7176f344", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7850", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 175600, "duration": 10.975}
{"id": "7850-281318-0005", "text": "SHE WAS INDEED A CLEVER BIRD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7850/281318/7850-281318-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "74fc3df20bfe8bb0ce60df982ca3fdd01e1daa382d65f40e6cbbc06cdb11deb4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7850", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 36320, "duration": 2.27}
{"id": "7850-286674-0015", "text": "THEY THOUGHT HE MIGHT BE GOING TO TAKE A NAP AFTER HIS DINNER", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7850/286674/7850-286674-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "41b39298e15e29425ee5ffa43067dc1eff94f52eb237dddbcf2b7dbf0cfb499a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7850", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 56480, "duration": 3.53}
{"id": "7850-73752-0000", "text": "FERDINAND MEDITATES OVER HIS GOOD FORTUNE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7850/73752/7850-73752-0000.flac", "audio_sha256": "1c04309e13aa11a914e669e5d7e097fe15b729742aaa2c341a6ca3a988fdeab4", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7850", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 50480, "duration": 3.155}
{"id": "7976-110124-0006", "text": "IT'S SURELY A TERRIBLE STORM OUTSIDE SAID THE MERCHANT'S ELDEST DAUGHTER AS THE WIND RATTLED THE TILES OF THE ROOF AND THE RAIN BEAT IN TORRENTS AGAINST THE DOORS AND WINDOWS", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7976/110124/7976-110124-0006.flac", "audio_sha256": "049125de667d6e1a7d6ede9dc9bb44ccfa6caebfa12a9eff7cd24573c94aaff7", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7976", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 169920, "duration": 10.62}
{"id": "7976-110124-0009", "text": "BUI WE SHOULD NOT FORGET OUR PROMISE TO OUR FATHER CRIED THE YOUNGEST DAUGHTER", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/7976/110124/7976-110124-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "f6cff50fdcdc17c0bf21d500a84f1101b24353890d946f4db703c0acd6f19105", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "7976", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 76960, "duration": 4.81}
{"id": "8297-275154-0015", "text": "I'M ALONE DO YOU HEAR THAT ALONE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275154/8297-275154-0015.flac", "audio_sha256": "14f35287cff0e572411d8a216b38841e087835a136513d4fd62844c65991811c", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 51520, "duration": 3.22}
{"id": "8297-275155-0020", "text": "BEFORE I CONSENTED TO ANSWER THE CHILD'S INQUIRIES I CAME TO AN UNDERSTANDING WITH HER MOTHER", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275155/8297-275155-0020.flac", "audio_sha256": "a18213bb6c8bfce9673487b3d4ddfdfbf7871e1ca2436c98c101f4cf87c4f0d9", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 110880, "duration": 6.93}
{"id": "8297-275156-0005", "text": "IN THE MEANTIME AFTER WHAT MISSUS PRESTY HAD CONFESSED THE CRUEL FALSEHOOD WHICH HAD CHECKED POOR KITTY'S NATURAL INQUIRIES RAISED AN INSUPERABLE OBSTACLE TO A MEETING BETWEEN FATHER AND CHILD", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8297/275156/8297-275156-0005.flac", "audio_sha256": "6e17c3186f3c4aa7420d5d3f9853a70e7a7037f0f9c46476489fdbfd6d341e36", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "8297", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 242880, "duration": 15.18}
{"id": "84-121550-0008", "text": "THIS EVERY OTHER SAVOUR DOTH TRANSCEND AND NOTWITHSTANDING SLAKED SO FAR MAY BE THY THIRST THAT I REVEAL TO THEE NO MORE", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/84/121550/84-121550-0008.flac", "audio_sha256": "b7be66ae8f221c8a06117aa4ffcd7d2ef7110e8a701527931d148097bc8ba99a", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "84", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 135120, "duration": 8.445}
{"id": "8842-302196-0009", "text": "IT IS THEREFORE AND ON ALL ACCOUNTS UNNECESSARY TO SAY MUCH MORE OF THE WORK HERE THAN IT SAYS FOR ITSELF", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8842/302196/8842-302196-0009.flac", "audio_sha256": "6ee93949d3948ef0de405f24f6eeb5978a94d4ecd85b71d297858a8e485e0ebd", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "8842", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 112880, "duration": 7.055}
{"id": "8842-302196-0010", "text": "THROUGHOUT THE VITA NUOVA THERE IS A STRAIN LIKE THE FIRST FALLING MURMUR WHICH REACHES THE EAR IN SOME REMOTE MEADOW AND PREPARES US TO LOOK UPON THE SEA", "audio": "/workspace/data/LibriSpeech/dev-clean/8842/302196/8842-302196-0010.flac", "audio_sha256": "6165ca7aa717d35a55719863aa7bd41254f3be335f2fd1b756eea9c5de217847", "corpus": "librispeech", "split": "dev-clean", "role": "validation", "language": "en", "speaker": "8842", "sample_rate": 16000, "samples": 133360, "duration": 8.335}
